	(text "M11/M12 (dinput4): car lines that close to ground (defogger D11, lights D12, blower D13, test mode D14,\nblow-by D24) with 680k pull-ups, and three aux inputs (launch / 2-step, map switch, spare) that expect 12 V.\n12 V-active switches (starter, A/C request, brake 1 and 2, clutch) and the cruise buttons are read on M1\nanalog inputs with the fitted pull-downs here. Crossed-out parts are options: see documents/README.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 22.86 0)
